1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:04,900
今年国内最大的一次地震
The biggest earthquake in China this year.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:09,500
西藏那曲巴青县
Baqing County, Nagqu, Tibet.

3
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:11,720
震源深度只有10公里
The focus was just 10 km deep.

4
00:00:11,720 --> 00:00:16,650
浅源地震地面震感通常更强
Shallow quakes usually shake the surface harder.

5
00:00:16,650 --> 00:00:22,300
5公里内3个村庄
Three villages within 5 km, two townships within 20 km.

6
00:00:22,300 --> 00:00:28,900
离拉萨399公里
57 km to Sog County, 399 km to Lhasa.

7
00:00:28,900 --> 00:00:35,450
平均海拔约4864米
Average altitude around the epicentre: about 4,864 m.

8
00:00:35,950 --> 00:00:42,500
以正式测定7.0级为准
The official reading is M7.0, not the early 6.7.

9
00:00:42,500 --> 00:00:47,300
余震不断23:13 4.2级
Aftershocks kept coming: M4.2 at 23:13.

10
00:00:47,300 --> 00:00:54,600
岗切乡2人受伤
Two injured in Gangqie; cracked houses near the epicentre.

11
00:00:54,600 --> 00:00:58,100
国家地震灾害4级应急响应
A national Level IV earthquake response is under way.

12
00:00:58,100 --> 00:01:02,300
灾情还在核实以官方发布为准
Damage is still being assessed. Follow official updates.

13
00:01:02,600 --> 00:01:05,500
愿平安
Stay safe.
